{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藍田啟田邨發生火警。今日（17日）下午約1時43分，啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，驚動多人報案。現場影片可見，起火單位位處高層，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。</p><p>消防接報趕抵，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，下午2時03分大致將火救熄。火警中，數十人疏散，初步有1男1女吸入濃煙不適、另有一名男子手指受傷；其中一人被送往聯合醫院治理。警方及消防正調查起火原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199364215467544576592614.jpeg/qCvmThWO5s5SeQ534zlZfQ51oDWP5mJqS0vuS0tL7ks\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有人吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375687291899904502761.jpeg/5sWDZd1M-A9nBjBDpadLmZzXlyOMhq-H13LkB_5y5Ac\"/><figcaption>有人吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有人吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375672447864832089451.jpeg/bN5qTfQtBmpYruIbeRu-3QXMEn3vU8IDw-miGOrpohg\"/><figcaption>有人吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有傷者吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375675342065664892563.jpeg/h56G7oo8VyR3O_E_v-xtZPhbkEGqlMWPVR48JHwePCQ\"/><figcaption>有傷者吸入濃煙不適。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"起火單位及樓上單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375679146168320654713.jpeg/woOvRkhoGQ9bw0H1tOqYlfIJf_qezqCz4Td0Ccg3dAk\"/><figcaption>起火單位及樓上單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"起火單位及樓上單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375681822265344761032.jpeg/lYNi5T-iqRhhjYOhelK_h4_ycbP0IaLxuo-FtpOPhbY\"/><figcaption>起火單位及樓上單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Derek Wong / 藍田關注組）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199366725682860032014689.jpeg/VajsBaJbtMXGxHOcW0_8YYE-0-JpjrIYLCZMgywmTIM\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Derek Wong / 藍田關注組）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375681348571136386710.jpeg/Zv2DYseYr3jmJ3AGXs81OvgPwR3_6Fsw5Nhgjc3YYI0\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375684196634624451689.jpeg/d3_4TxkrzdlD07DKb11vQJuv-83VXhGldyhIn14oSJ8\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375678278209536528391.jpeg/A9XBc5KFrOP1GodhGsV5rqHtLOfb5ztIN4CyVR6AslU\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375679276191744632908.jpeg/0pFTqUi3ekNVfpS2CFNLEpkBSUe3VYyvRuv_72_r_-8\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375682120060928863951.jpeg/U71-a2g1m3Tc5FjEytQ9nkW_xthYW1_EIgxdUgsMXVI\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375684666134528325649.jpeg/eoHZqWvRdnFDruuWzs3U37g7n74KLWt_d2UKQ15lCkM\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375685077176320753824.jpeg/kK6Delw3vbP-40ZM9jKMlba4Irj3uSB2EANgODkDYDg\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375689015758848978153.jpeg/nYK3cPGf_Jjc0-7vD3i11uxD5p9pHqco_14SctZeEnI\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199375691838656512641029.jpeg/GmlcbPue6bitPu4Lo_-5qM7RIFyrel_vmiiiKbMooik\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田啟田邨啟旺樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199364213152157696825934.jpeg/huxS9_St792NL5TIHIv8fYKogCYdVWREXGQ4Z1xkOGc\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:10:00.250030+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":581,"images":17,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:14:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:34.864794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:21.787787+00:00","content_hash":"e8f9eff1354821bfc2e0a042baaf5e32f4768b0380e581d797a80f578eae02de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}